// /Hints/Stamps/Links:Remove Link To

// This stamp allows a third-party execution context to
// remove a link to a specified note from the Stamp's target.
// For this to work, the Stamp target (i.e., “this”) must have
// these attribute settings:
//   $MyNumber(target) contains the $ID of the to-note
//   $MyString(target) optionally provides the Link Type
//
// The third-party will set these attributes in the target,
// and then execute:
//    stamp(target,"Links:Remove Link To");

// LogRec(StampLog,"source: "+$ID+" dest: "+$MyNumber+" type: "+$MyString);

unlinkTo($MyNumber,$MyString);


